ist":false,"_score_mult_vs_hist":54.2,"_gate_fcf_yield":0.04440289173918793,"_gp_fcf_yield":false,"_score_fcf_yield":20.8,"_gate_int_coverage":10.101342238777214,"_gp_int_coverage":true,"_score_int_coverage":47.9,"_gate_net_debt_ebitda":1.2227407233330296,"_gp_net_debt_ebitda":true,"_score_net_debt_ebitda":61.7,"_gate_accruals":-0.040509222756045224,"_gp_accruals":true,"_score_accruals":51.7,"_gate_rev_volatility":0.10303569825246882,"_gp_rev_volatility":true,"_score_rev_volatility":84.8,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.0051772406228600965,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":true,"_score_margin_vs_hist":93.5,"_gate_piotroski":4,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":44.4,"_gate_spread":0.04823692521827566,"_gp_spread":false,"_score_spread":24.1,"_gate_roic_consistency":0.23352057872902432,"_gp_roic_consistency":true,"_score_roic_consistency":61.1,"_gate_incr_roic":0.07478502604219008,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":41.6,"_gate_margin_advantage":0.06079652721171419,"_gp_margin_advantage":true,"_score_margin_advantage":53.6,"_gate_pool_share":0.016601287787127106,"_gp_pool_share":true,"_score_pool_share":46.6,"_gate_rev_durability":0.10431618316927183,"_gp_rev_durability":true,"_score_rev_durability":77.2,"_gate_fcf_durability":0.12585723116953806,"_gp_fcf_durability":true,"_score_fcf_durability":87.9,"_gate_margins":0.00583620677210282,"_gp_margins":true,"_score_margins":55.8,"_gate_fund_growth":0.035092094563853524,"_gp_fund_growth":true,"_score_fund_growth":35.1,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.0032240160309980766,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":14.7,"_gate_share_shrink":0.0035203509280565815,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":45.6,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.010683793174232691,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":82.2,"_gate_insider_own":0.00712,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":4.7,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Kadant Inc. supplies technologies and engineered systems worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Flow Control, Industrial Processing, and Material Handling. The Flow Control segment develops, manufactures, and markets fluid-handling systems, equipment, and integrated technologies, such as rotary joints, syphons, Turbulator bars, expansion joints, and engineered steam and condensate systems, as well as doctor systems and holders, doctor blades, cleaning showers and fabric-conditioning systems, forming systems and wear surfaces, and water-filtration systems. The Industrial Processing segment provides ring and rotary debarkers, stranders, chippers, engineered knife systems, and industrial automation and control products. This segment also offers recycling and approach flow systems, virgin pulping process equipment, boiler cleaning technologies, and single and double-screw presses. The Material Handling segment provides vibratory and conveying equipment; individual components and equipment for baling recyclable and waste materials; and fiber-based products. It sells its products and services through direct sales, independent sales agents, and distributors. The company was formerly known as Thermo Fibertek, Inc. and changed its name to Kadant Inc. in July 2001. Kadant Inc. was incorporated in 1991 and is headquartered in Westford, Massachusetts.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Jeffrey L. Powell | CEO & Director | Age 66 | Compensation: $2.5M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 4K people. Revenue per employee of $263K ranks in the below the sector median among Industrials peers, with revenue growing 9%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $39K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $3K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 9\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["Kadant Inc is a mid-cap industrials business with a $3.5B market cap on $1.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +5% over the past three years and +10% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 14% against a 9% cost of capital, a 5-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it.","The business throws off $154M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 15 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.68\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 1.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 10.1\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.3%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (10.5% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 6% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Supply chain reshoring costs and labour shortages \u2014 onshoring mandates raise capex requirements while a shrinking skilled-labour pool inflates operating costs.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","12 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Technical Reactions to KAI Trends in Macro Strategies","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/38/Technical_Reactions_to_KAI_Trends_in_Macro_Strategies_111226053202_1794479522.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794479522.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Is Kadant (KAI) Undervalued On Strong Q3 Results And Raised 2026 Guidance?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nyse-kai/kadant/news/is-kadant-kai-undervalued-on-strong-q3-results-and-raised-20","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794392595.918,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.714,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"All You Need to Know About Kadant (KAI) Rating Upgrade to Buy","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3027542/all-you-need-to-know-about-kadant-kai-rating-upgrade-to-buy?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_12_zacks_rank_upgrade-3027542","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794339806.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["m_and_a","analyst_action"]},{"title":"Kadant Inc (KAI) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Record Revenue, Bookings Surge 23%, and ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/kadant-inc-kai-q3-2026-231337676.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793834017.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Kadant (KAI) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/kadant-kai-q3-2026-earnings-204809000.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793825717.0,"origin":"tiingo","senti